\"?note=1c9c7148ba67afbb\" title=\"29-cor-fo-ac0\">29-cor-fo-ac0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c44b3d89fc5839f\" href=\"?note=9c44b3d89fc5839f\" title=\"29-thm-lfp-ptime\">29-thm-lfp-ptime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd4992ce7beaa916\" href=\"?note=fd4992ce7beaa916\" title=\"29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp\">29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"560196b62ae7159f\" href=\"?note=560196b62ae7159f\" title=\"29-thm-fagin-1974\">29-thm-fagin-1974</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e052662a4a07aa17\" href=\"?note=e052662a4a07aa17\" title=\"29-thm-ph-equivalence\">29-thm-ph-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorems4.10,7.8,10.13; Corollaries5.32,7.22"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"五个既有捕获结果的同域注册；证明核验范围继承相应原子"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\notin\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_&lt;\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)}\\}\">\\(\\tau_&lt;\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)}\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；真正带序结构为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_&lt;]\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_&lt;]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 的同域接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a> 的一阶一致性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;],\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau_&lt;]\">\\(Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;],\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau_&lt;]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau_&lt;]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau_&lt;]\\)</span> 分别取链接的 Fagin 与 PH 定理。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_&lt;]\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_&lt;]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\tau(X)\">\\(\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\)</span> 在下式定义为沿有序扩张拉回的查询。注册项均为查询类的有序对，不能把逻辑名称当作已有查询集合。</li>\n<li>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{ord}\\)</span> 只标识以下注册表的有序输入范围。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CapturePairs}_{\\mathrm{ord}}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau],\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;]\\},\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau_&lt;]\\}\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;]\\},\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau_&lt;]\\}\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CapturePairs}_{\\mathrm{ord}}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau],\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;]\\},\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{NP}[\\tau_&lt;]\\}\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau_&lt;]\\},\\{\\Phi_\\tau(X)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau_&lt;]\\}\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>汇总表与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1c9c7148ba67afbb\" href=\"?note=1c9c7148ba67afbb\" title=\"29-cor-fo-ac0\">29-cor-fo-ac0</a> 统一采用原书的一阶一致 AC0；不再保留缺来源接口的 DLOGTIME 下标。后三个来源中各自的证明限制继续有效，本条只是已有刻画的注册，不提供新的独立证明。显式拉回使 SO/ESO 的一般结构查询与其余有序输入比较处于同一论域。</p>\n<p>本轮修正汇总中最后的有序对/结构混用；所有模型类注册均沿真正的扩张映射拉回。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-cor-fo-ac0","status":"resolved","id":"1c9c7148ba67afbb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-cor-fo-ac0]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-lfp-ptime","status":"resolved","id":"9c44b3d89fc5839f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-lfp-ptime]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp","status":"resolved","id":"fd4992ce7beaa916","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-fagin-1974","status":"resolved","id":"560196b62ae7159f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-fagin-1974]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ph-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"e052662a4a07aa17","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ph-equivalence]]"